# Riding on the Clouds (jeuno 131): the range of the four draws, both sides. Each available talk to Maat sets
# npcSandoria, npcBastok, npcWindurst and npcOtherlands to math.randomInt(0, 7) (in that order, the seeded script RNG)
# and sends them in 88; option 0 sets them back to 0. Fifty talks in a row (200 draws, 50 per var), each
# talk's 88 in its comment. Each var shows both 0 and 7 (npcSandoria 0 at draw 16, 7 at 3; npcBastok 0 at 1, 7 at 5;
# npcWindurst 0 at 13, 7 at 12; npcOtherlands 0 at 6, 7 at 42), so a range that starts at 1 or stops at 6 differs,
# and a wider range differs in the draws themselves (the mutants of the report).
lists RuludeGardens/Maat/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/88
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=WAR lvl=61
levelcap 65
login
trigger Maat                            # draw 1: 88 (1, 0, 2, 2, 180)
finish option=0                         # the four vars set to 0
trigger Maat                            # draw 2: 88 (4, 2, 3, 6, 180)
finish option=0                         # the four vars set to 0
trigger Maat                            # draw 3: 88 (7, 3, 4, 6, 180)
finish option=0                         # the four vars set to 0
trigger Maat                            # draw 4: 88 (3, 1, 6, 1, 180)
finish option=0                         # the four vars set to 0
trigger Maat                            # draw 5: 88 (5, 7, 5, 3, 180)
finish option=0                         # the four vars set to 0
trigger Maat                            # draw 6: 88 (2, 1, 6, 0, 180)
finish option=0                         # the four vars set to 0
trigger Maat                            # draw 7: 88 (2, 6, 2, 4, 180)
